  "decision": "Two Seedream 5.0 Flash edits failed geographic placement. Select FLUX.3 Image for the Alpine root and preserved composition. MiniMax H3 offers native 2K 21:9 and first/last-frame control; H3 Max is newer and cheaper but limited to 768p. Grok Lite is newer but lacks 21:9 and last-frame support. Wan 3.0 lacks 21:9. Seedance 2.5 is limited to 720p. Preserve detail at full hero width for a bounded approximately $1 take.",
